[{"code":"list_still_used","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/direct/BridgeCallbackReturnsParameter.beni","start":{"line":17,"col":9},"end":{"line":17,"col":33}},"title":"LIST CHANGED WHILE STILL IN USE","message":"`BridgeCallbackReturnsParameter.pushReturned` changes `xs` in place, but `xs` is\nread again afterwards.\n\n17|    r = pushReturned xs identity\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n18|    { f0 = r, f2 = xs }\n                      ^^ and `xs` is read here, after the change\n\nIf the list were changed in place, `xs` would see the change when it is read on\nline 18.\n\nTo change a copy and leave `xs` as it was, copy it there:\n\n17|    r = pushReturned (List.copy xs) identity\n\nThis is sharing the checker can see: `xs` is read on line 18, after the change."}]
